=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:120%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:2; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Comment \n                                        by </span></font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Edge</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;:</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"470\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"26\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/edge.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:55/60\" width=\"55\"></b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"424\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하피들의 리더격인 스톤하피를 중심으로 뭉쳐있는 모습을 볼 수 있다. </span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">반은 새이고 반은 여자의 몸이며, 재물을 좋아하고 탐욕스럽다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:20%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:10; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그러나 그렇게 \n강하지는 않은 몬스터, 머리수로 승부하는게 그들 나름대로의 전략이다. 숲속에서도 한두마리씩 보일때가 있다.</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:20%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
